cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use nmrflow in academic work, please cite this software and its version."
title: "nmrflow: SMILES-based NMR/HRMS prediction"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Yu"
    given-names: "Jiang Keal"
version: "0.3.2"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24192947"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.24192947"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Leak2/nmrflow-predictors"
url: "https://github.com/Leak2/nmrflow-predictors/releases/tag/v0.3.2"
abstract: >-
  nmrflow predicts 1H/13C (and optional 19F/31P) NMR spectra, literature-style
  reported values, and HRMS m/z from a SMILES string. Outputs are predictions,
  not experimental data. The code is BSD-3-Clause; the bundled HOSE index is a
  derivative of NMRShiftDB2 and is distributed under the nmrshiftdb2 Database
  License.
keywords:
  - NMR
  - cheminformatics
  - SMILES
  - HRMS
  - spectrum prediction
  - RDKit
